#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#371 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#372 (mes)
- "I am perfectly hidden!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#373 (mes)
- "To become undetectable can only be done by the greatest Assassins!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#374 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#375 (mes)
- "Aren't you scared that you can't see me? I could kill you at any time and it would be so easy..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#376 (select)
- "I think I crapped my pants!:You're all talk. I challenge you!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#377 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#378 (mes)
- "Now I see that"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#379 (mes)
- "you're nothing"
