- "Hmpf, if you really don't have a clue, I will give you a little advice."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#613 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#614 (mes)
- "Go ask 'Khai,' the guy who takes care of your test application, maybe he will help you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#615 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#616 (mes)
- "You may also wish to take advantage of the ancient code, ^3355FFiro.ragnarokonline.com^000000. Supposedly, those words are linked to a vast body of otherworldly knowledge..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#618 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#619 (mes)
- "...I will keep watching you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#629 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#630 (mes)
- "You can't take the next trial without passing the written test first. You better speak to the Anonymous One..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#632 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#634 (mes)
- "..."
+ "..."
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#635 (mes)
- "You passed the test..?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#636 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#637 (mes)
- "To be honest, I want to grant you the job change without any other condition. Too many pathetic people don't even have the basic knowledge to be Assassins..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#638 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#639 (mes)
- "We must keep our dignity as Assassins and be truly great! Regrettably, there are too many idiots that don't have any pride."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#640 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#641 (mes)
- "All Assassins must respect the enemies they slay, the blood that they spill, and above all, maintain their sense of dignity!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#642 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#643 (mes)
- "Alright. This next trial will test your ability to quickly find your target."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#644 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#645 (mes)
- "If you're going to be an Assassin, we need to determine whether or not you can distinguish friend from foe in an instant."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#646 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#647 (mes)
- "The main goal of this test is to find and kill as many monsters named ^008800Job change target^000000 as possible."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#648 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#649 (mes)
- "You must kill at least"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#650 (mes)
- "6 ^008800Job change target^000000 monsters. They're intermingled among similar looking monsters, so you need to be careful..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#651 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#652 (mes)
- "If you fail, you'll have to restart this test. Go to the room above"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#653 (mes)
- "me to be transported to the Test Hall."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#654 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#655 (mes)
- "Only one person is allowed to take the test at a time, so if anyone is taking the test, you'll have to wait until that person finishes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#656 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#657 (mes)
- "Hey, don't be too hard"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#658 (mes)
- "on yourself. Cheer up!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#659 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#660 (mes)
- "Hmm, if you're exhausted, I'm willing to bring you back. Of course, if you leave, you'll have to take the job test over again. So what do you want to do?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#661 (select)
- "Continue!:Quit the job change test for now."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#662 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#663 (mes)
- "Good choice!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#664 (mes)
- "Remember, you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#665 (mes)
- "must find and kill"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#666 (mes)
- "6 ^008800Job change target^000000 monsters!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#667 (mes)
- "Good luck!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#668 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#669 (mes)
- "Alright..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#670 (mes)
- "I guess you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#671 (mes)
- "could use a break..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#866 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#867 (mes)
- "Damn...! You look like you're in a lot of pain. ^666666*Sigh*^000000 Give me a second, let me try to restore your HP and SP..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#868 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#869 (mes)
- "It looks like you're having a tough time. You're either trying too hard, or not trying hard"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#870 (mes)
- "enough, kid."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#871 (select)
- "I'm gonna try it again!:I... I quit!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#872 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#873 (mes)
- "Hmm. Well, okay."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#874 (mes)
- "Good luck out there."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#875 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#876 (mes)
- "Huh..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#877 (mes)
- "Quit the test, eh? Well, I guess you don't wanna waste any more of our time."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#878 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#879 (mes)
- "Oh hey, don't forget to save your respawn point in town."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#885 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#886 (mes)
- "Hey, I'm Thomas. I'm in charge of testing your use of the hiding skill. Think you're up to it?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#887 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#888 (mes)
- "Listen. In this test, you can't kill any monsters. Your goal is to reach 'Barcardi' at the opposite side of this room."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#889 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#890 (mes)
- "So basically, get to the other side of this room and meet 'Barcardi' without killing a single monster. Understand?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#891 (mes)
- "[Thomas]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#892 (mes)
- "If you run away, get a nose bleed and pass out or something like that, I'll fail ya'. Enough talk. Let's see what you got."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#985 (mes)
- "[Barcardi]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#986 (mes)
- "Oh! Congratulations!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#987 (mes)
- "You may now proceed to our Guildmaster's room. Good luck!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#996 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#997 (mes)
- "Welcome. "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#998 (mes)
- "This place is called the 'Guildmaster's room,' the deepest place in the Assassin guild."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#999 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1000 (mes)
- "I'm going to give you a simple test. Please find your way through this maze and come to me. It is this maze that protects our guild from intruders."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1001 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1002 (mes)
- "I look forward"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1003 (mes)
- "to meeting you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1004 (mes)
- "at the end of maze."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1009 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1010 (mes)
- "Welcome."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1011 (mes)
- "I apologize for"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1012 (mes)
- "making you go"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1013 (mes)
- "through the maze."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1014 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1015 (mes)
- "I saw your resume just now. You're well known as a Thief with guts. Rarely do we receive potential Assassins of your stature."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1016 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1017 (mes)
- "May I ask you some questions if you don't mind? You don't have to be nervous. Just remember: if you lie, I will kill you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1018 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1019 (mes)
- "First off, what do you think is the priority of an Assassin?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1020 (select)
- "More power.:An Assassin's pride.:Endless practice."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1021 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1022 (mes)
- "More power..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1023 (mes)
- "Yes, you may think"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1024 (mes)
- "of Assassins as much"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1025 (mes)
- "stronger than Thieves."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1026 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1027 (mes)
- "However, for what reason do you wish for more power? To show off? Personal revenge? For what purpose will you use this power?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1028 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1029 (mes)
- "Why do you want"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1030 (mes)
- "to be stronger"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1031 (mes)
- "than you are now?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1032 (select)
- "Revenge...!:Money~:I want to travel."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1033 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1034 (mes)
- "Revenge...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1035 (mes)
- "Yes, I understand. All of us hold grudges against someone else eventually."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1036 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1037 (mes)
- "However, keep in mind that we are not allowed to be emotionally attached. Carry out your duties without question. That is our way."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1038 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1039 (mes)
- "Being an Assassin means"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1040 (mes)
- "to abandon the ego."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1041 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1042 (mes)
- "Financial reasons...? I won't deny that we all need money to live. But being Assassin means living for a higher purpose."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1043 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1044 (mes)
- "Being an Assassin means"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1045 (mes)
- "to abandon such worldly"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1046 (mes)
- "attachments..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1047 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1048 (mes)
- "Good idea. Traveling around the world will allow you to broaden your experiences."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1049 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1050 (mes)
- "Most of us tend to avoid gathering into groups though, but I'm sure you already caught that, yes?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1051 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1052 (mes)
- "In a way, being an Assassin is to live life in loneliness..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1053 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1054 (mes)
- "An Assassin's pride..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1055 (mes)
- "Did other Assassins tell you that...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1056 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1057 (mes)
- "Pride is certainly important, but pride is worth nothing if you do not have any ability."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1058 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1059 (mes)
- "Most of the Assassins you've met before me are brethren that have shared many difficult times together."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1060 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1061 (mes)
- "I can understand why their pride and dignity would be so important to them. Now, for what reason do you wish to become an Assassin?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1062 (select)
- "I like the solitude.:Making money being an Assassin.:They just look interesting."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1063 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1064 (mes)
- "You got the point..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1065 (mes)
- "We are lonely. We will always be alone, even amongst each other..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1066 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1067 (mes)
- "In a way, being"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1068 (mes)
- "an Assassin equals"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1069 (mes)
- "nothing, I would say."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1070 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1071 (mes)
- "But, as I told you before, we have comrades. I recommend having at least one comrade to back up you when you're on a mission."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1072 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1073 (mes)
- "Well, I can't deny it, we do need money to make a living. But don't you think we should pursue something even more important than money?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1074 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1075 (mes)
- "Style and appearance is only superficial. It is sad that many people think this way..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1076 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1077 (mes)
- "Such disgraceful Assassins that have lost their true focus are dealt with in our own manner..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1078 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1079 (mes)
- "Don't forget..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1080 (mes)
- "Assassins don't toy around. We are not into a style or trend, and we never will be."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1081 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1082 (mes)
- "Endless Practice..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1083 (mes)
- "I think you have what it takes. Is there a reason you want to be an Assassin?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1084 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1085 (mes)
- "Unlike the Thief class, the Assassin job doesn't allow self-indulgence. Tell me the"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1086 (mes)
- "reason you train endlessly."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1087 (select)
- "To broaden my skills.:It's a goal of mine.:For spiritual improvement."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1088 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1089 (mes)
- "Learning skills comes naturally with the Assassin job. But don't think of skills as the best value of your training."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1090 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1091 (mes)
- "You won't be satisfied in becoming an Assassin if you think this..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1092 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1093 (mes)
- "It's a goal of yours, eh? Well, I guess you've got to have goals..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1094 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1095 (mes)
- "I once knew a person who had goals. Long ago, I met someone on assignment who wanted to keep from getting killed before becoming a level 54 knight."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1096 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1097 (mes)
- "It's to bad I had to kill him before he was level 52... ^666666*Sigh*^000000 Oh well."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1098 (mes)
- "I'm a bit worried about you. I hope you realize that once you become an Assassin, there's no turning back..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1099 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1100 (mes)
- "Good idea..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1101 (mes)
- "That is a good way to improve yourself. I've seen many people who know how to be strong physically but not in their mental state."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1102 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1103 (mes)
- "I hope you're not a hypocrite. Spiritual discipline is the best way for you to survive."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1104 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1105 (mes)
- "Sadly, there are some nit-wits who are eager to be Assassins even though they don't know anything..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1106 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1107 (mes)
- "They cause problems and bring us disgrace. Their activities often result in horrible situations."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1108 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1109 (mes)
- "Be careful lest you become one of them once you become an Assassin. The responsibility rests solely on your shoulders..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1110 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1111 (mes)
- "So if you could become an Assassin right now, what is the first thing you would do?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1112 (select)
- "I would go hunt right away.:There are people waiting for me.:Check how I can help as an Assassin."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1113 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1114 (mes)
- "Hunt..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1115 (mes)
- "Is that all...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1116 (select)
- "I would level up fast.:I want to explore my Assassin skills.:I will go where I couldn't go as a Thief."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1117 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1118 (mes)
- "Don't act recklessly..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1119 (mes)
- "Being an Assassin never makes you a different person. And don't rely on chance."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1120 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1121 (mes)
- "It is good for one to examine oneself. I can understand that you will be excited by the great change in your ability."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1122 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1123 (mes)
- "In the meantime, I hope you won't forget the Assassin mentality."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1124 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1125 (mes)
- "Very well..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1126 (mes)
- "Exploring places you've never seen before. But know that being an Assassin never makes you a different person."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1127 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1128 (mes)
- "Don't force yourself too much."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1129 (mes)
- "Take your time and travel wisely."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1130 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1131 (mes)
- "Who is waiting"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1132 (mes)
- "for you, might I ask?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1133 (select)
- "My friends.:My Guildsmen.:My lover."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1134 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1135 (mes)
- "I see..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1136 (mes)
- "Appreciate them for caring about you, even when you're alone."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1137 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1138 (mes)
- "Great..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1139 (mes)
- "Comrades for whom you would die for..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1140 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1141 (mes)
- "As an Assassin, find a job that you can do for them without them knowing.."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1142 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1143 (mes)
- "Haha, the needs of the body are sometimes hard to ignore. It's best to accept that part of human nature."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1144 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1145 (mes)
- "But you must never reveal to her the Assassin side of your life. No matter what it takes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1146 (mes)
- "But you must never reveal to him the Assassin side of your life, no matter what it takes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1147 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1148 (mes)
- "Love your beloved forever, even if you can't openly express it. Sometimes, life doesn't allow you to find true love more than once."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1149 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1150 (mes)
- "That's most admirable. Is there anything that you would like to ask me about?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1151 (select)
- "Places where Assassins can level up...:Main goals as an Assassin.:Financial consulting."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1152 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1153 (mes)
- "It all depends on your mind. Any place could be the best to level up according to your mind state."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1154 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1155 (mes)
- "You must know how to"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1156 (mes)
- "survive in any situation."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1157 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1158 (mes)
- "There are many Assassins out there. Look to them as your trainers, and ask for their opinions."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1159 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1160 (mes)
- "I hope you will become an excellent Assassin. And when you reach a certain level, you must guide newbies as your trainers have."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1161 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1162 (mes)
- "Oh my lord..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1163 (mes)
- "Are you planning to become an Assassin in order to make money?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1164 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1165 (mes)
- "People of that nature are unwelcome. If such is your goal, you may wish to reconsider your job..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1166 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1167 (mes)
- "It was nice to meet you. You reminded me of the good ol' days."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1168 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1169 (mes)
- "Please give me"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1170 (mes)
- "one second..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1174 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1175 (mes)
- "Those involved with the testing of "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1176 (mes)
- ", please gather before me."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1177 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1178 (mes)
- "They will"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1179 (mes)
- "be here soon."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1187 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1188 (mes)
- "I am here."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1189 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1190 (mes)
- "I would like to listen to your opinion of "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1191 (mes)
- " for the job change test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1192 (mes)
- "[The Anonymous One]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1193 (mes)
- "Ah yeah..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1194 (mes)
- "I think"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1197 (mes)
- "is decent."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1198 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1199 (mes)
- "Well..."
+ "Bom..."
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1200 (mes)
- "The Anonymous One"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1201 (mes)
- "supports you. How"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1202 (mes)
- "about you, Huey?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1203 (mes)
- "[Huey]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1204 (mes)
- "A rarity."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1205 (mes)
- "You can tell"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1206 (mes)
- "by the job level."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1207 (mes)
- "[Huey]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1208 (mes)
- "I agree with"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1209 (mes)
- "the Anonymous One."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1210 (mes)
- "[Huey]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1211 (mes)
- "Although "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1212 (mes)
- " looks too mellow and gentle, kind of like a pussycat, "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1213 (mes)
- " has the stuff."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1214 (mes)
- "[Huey]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1215 (mes)
- "If it's alright with you, I'd like to get back to my job."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1216 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1217 (mes)
- "Yes..."
+ "Sim..."
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1218 (mes)
- "That is all, Huey."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1219 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1220 (mes)
- "So..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1221 (mes)
- "'Beholder,' what"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1222 (mes)
- "is your opinion?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1224 (mes)
- "[Beholder]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1225 (mes)
- "Well, I don't like the course score. But, somehow the whole test was passed. I'm okay with this person."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1226 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1227 (mes)
- "Hmm..."
+ "Hmm..."
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1228 (mes)
- "It seems we are all in agreement. Good. I don't have any problem with "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1229 (mes)
- " as well..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1230 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1231 (mes)
- "Even though you're driven by personal revenge, I hope it will go away as you train..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1232 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1233 (mes)
- "Even though your main concern for now is being a rich, I'm sure you'll pursue something even greater..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1234 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1235 (mes)
- "Eager to travel all around the world, I hope your real identity is found in your journeys..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1236 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1237 (mes)
- "You seem to know a lot about Assassins. I don't think frustration from being alone will be difficult for you..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1238 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1239 (mes)
- "You have an idiocy about money, but I believe that you should be able to overcome it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1240 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1241 (mes)
- "Although I do not trust you for now, I will give you a chance..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1242 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1243 (mes)
- "Even though you're enamored with Assassins superficially, I believe you will realize the real value of the Assassin job sooner or later."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1244 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1245 (mes)
- "One of the rare people who seeks better skills, I hope you will realize the importance of spiritual discipline sooner or later."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1246 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1247 (mes)
- "Sooner or later, you will find a new goal to which you can devote yourself..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1248 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1249 (mes)
- "I know some people care only about their physical training, but"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1250 (mes)
- "I believe you stand out amongst them..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1251 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1252 (mes)
- "Well, I've said too much. Please choose a weapon as a present."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1253 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1254 (mes)
- "You can choose a Jur, Katar, Main Gauche, or a Gladius. As a master, I love them all."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1255 (select)
- "Jur:Katar:Main Gauche:Gladius"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1256 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1257 (mes)
- "A Jur..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1258 (mes)
- "Good choice. There you are. I hope it will serve you well."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1259 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1260 (mes)
- "A Katar..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1261 (mes)
- "Here you are."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1262 (mes)
- "Although it's used,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1263 (mes)
- "I know it will"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1264 (mes)
- "serve you well."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1265 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1266 (mes)
- "I see. You want to use both hands. Here, take your Main Gauche."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1267 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1268 (mes)
- "A Gladius..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1269 (mes)
- "It used to rule over the Assassin weapon market. Please take care of my gladius."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1270 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1271 (mes)
- "Well, I talked too much."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1272 (mes)
- "Please take this first."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1273 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1274 (mes)
- "Well, I am giving you a token. Please return to the Assassin expert, the Ferocious-Looking Huey, at the entrance."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1275 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1276 (mes)
- "Upon receiving this token, Huey will promote you to an Assassin."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1277 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1278 (mes)
- "You, "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1279 (mes)
- ", have chosen to live as an Assassin. May you learn our ways and be an honorable example to others."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1282 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1283 (mes)
- "Okay, all of you may go back to your positions. I will send you to the entrance as well. Let's move..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1292 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1293 (mes)
- "Umm...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1294 (mes)
- "How come you're in here...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1295 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1296 (mes)
- "You already finished your test. Why don't you go try to get the ^006699Necklace of Oblivion^000000 so you can change your job?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1298 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1299 (mes)
- "What the hell? You pressed 'Cancel' during the process. Do you want to change your job or what?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1300 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1301 (mes)
- "^666666*Sigh...*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1302 (mes)
- "Ok, let's start again. If you don't listen this time, you won't leave this room alive. You got me?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1303 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1304 (mes)
- "Umm? How come your in here?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1305 (mes)
- "[Guildmaster]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/assassin.txt#1306 (mes)
- "You already finished your test, go give your ^006699Necklace of Oblivion^000000 to the Ferocious-looking guy so you can change your job!"
