- "We are Workers of Steel,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/blacksmith.txt#18 (mes)
- "the Blacksmith Guild."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/blacksmith.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Altiregen]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/blacksmith.txt#20 (mes)
- "We pour the fervor"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/blacksmith.txt#21 (mes)
- "and passion of our souls into"
