- "already a fine Swordman."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1465 (mes)
- "Is there a particular reason you wish to be a Knight?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1466 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1467 (mes)
- "I don't know about"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1468 (mes)
- "Swordmen, but Knights do not allow self-indulgence. There are those so obsessed with gaining strength that they cannot control themselves."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1469 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1470 (mes)
- "So..."
