#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1496 (mes)
- "And then?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1497 (select)
- "I will grow within a short period of time.:I would like to test my ability as a Knight.:I would like to go to more challenging places."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1498 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1499 (mes)
- "Don't be in too much of a hurry to become strong. Even if you become"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1500 (mes)
- "a Knight, you are still yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1501 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1502 (mes)
- "Testing yourself is a good thing. It's okay to be happy about how you change, but don't forget about the true qualities of being a Knight."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1503 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1504 (mes)
- "Even if you become a Knight, you are not changing your inner self. No need to overwork yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1505 (mes)
- "Relax and take things step by step."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1506 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1507 (mes)
- "Who is"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1508 (mes)
- "waiting for you?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1509 (select)
- "My friends.:My Guild members.:My Lover."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1510 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1511 (mes)
- "I see, they would share in the joy of your achievements. Don't ever lose your kind heart, and always give help to your friends."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1512 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1513 (mes)
- "Those who would share in your happiness and hardship. As a Knight, you must always protect them."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1514 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1515 (mes)
- "Oh, youth!"
