#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1527 (mes)
- "Sincere affection"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1528 (mes)
- "is hard to find."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1529 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1530 (mes)
- "Good attitude..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1531 (mes)
- "What do you plan"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1532 (mes)
- "on learning?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1533 (select)
- "Comfortable places for Knights to go...:The different paths of a Knight...:Ways to get more money as a Knight..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1534 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1535 (mes)
- "There are many places that are comfortable or uncomfortable in this world. However Knights must"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1536 (mes)
- "be able to survive anywhere."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1537 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1538 (mes)
- "There are many similar Knights outside in the world. Think of them as your seniors and ask many questions."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1539 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1540 (mes)
- "Oh no. Do you hold wealth as a priority of being a Knight? We're not meant to be that way. Come again when you have thought"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1541 (mes)
- "more about it..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1542 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1543 (mes)
- "Oh no, we've been"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1544 (mes)
- "talking too much..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1545 (mes)
- "I apologize for"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1546 (mes)
- "keeping you here"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1547 (mes)
- "for so long."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1548 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1549 (mes)
- "I enjoyed talking with you. You remind me of myself as a young recruit. Shall we talk to the captain and decide on your"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1550 (mes)
- "job change?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1551 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1552 (mes)
- "Don't worry too"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1553 (mes)
- "much, I have a very"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1554 (mes)
- "high opinion of you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1555 (mes)
- "Now, go~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1556 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1557 (mes)
- "I enjoyed speaking with you. You can think about the principles of Knighthood more once you become a Knight."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1558 (mes)
- "[Sir Gray]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/knight.txt#1559 (mes)
- "Then, shall we go to the captain and decide on your job change? Don't worry too much. You are good enough to be a Knight!"
