### npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt  (845 textos)
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#2 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#3 (mes)
- "Hm...?"
+ "Hum...?"
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#4 (mes)
- "Ah, I sense that you are a warrior that has been to Valhalla. You who have been reborn... We are here to look after you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#5 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#6 (mes)
- "Do not let evil conquer your soul. You have enough courage and power to overcome the hardest situation. May God bless you..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#8 (mes)
- "Ah..."
+ "Ah..."
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#9 (mes)
- "It is good to see you again, Brother "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#10 (mes)
- ". Once again, God's grace has caused our paths to cross."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#11 (mes)
- "It is good to see you once again, Sister "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#12 (mes)
- ". The grace of God has brought you once more before me."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#13 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#14 (mes)
- "I'm pleased to see that you are continuing to lead the children of God on the right path. Is there anything I can help you with today?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#15 (select)
