#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#38 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#39 (mes)
- "I see, take your time. Don't forget to bring a ^0000FFRosary^000000..."
