#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#104 (mes)
- "I see. So you wish to be a Priest. God will be delighted by your decision and will bless you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#105 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#106 (mes)
- "I am Bishop Paul Cervantes, and am in charge of the Prontera Parish."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#107 (mes)
- "I am glad to meet a person as eager and devoted to God such as yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#108 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#109 (mes)
- "If you set your mind on becoming a Priest, you must undergo several tests. Only Acolytes who reach job level 40 are qualified for testing."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#110 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#111 (mes)
- "If you satisfy the requirements, I suggest that you apply for the Priest job first. Do you wish to apply now?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#112 (select)
- "Yes, I do.:I need some time to think about it..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#113 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#114 (mes)
- "You are not yet qualified to be a Priest. Please go out into the world and broaden your experiences."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#115 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#116 (mes)
- "There are still things that you must learn as an Acolyte. However, I look forward to meeting you again very soon."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#117 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#118 (mes)
- "You have skill points left."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#119 (mes)
- "I strongly recommend that you use all of these skill points before you apply for the Priest job change test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#120 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#121 (mes)
- "Now I will explain the Three Trials of Priesthood. These tribulations will bring you much suffering, but I hope you can complete them, Brother "
