#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#141 (select)
- "I am ready.:Give me a minute."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#142 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#143 (mes)
- "Good. I will send you to the training ground. When you get there, please speak to Brother Peter who is in charge of the training."
