#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#145 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#146 (mes)
- "No problem, take your time."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#147 (mes)
- "May God give you the strength to overcome your fears..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#148 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#149 (mes)
- "Well, let me tell you the order of the ascetic Priests that you must visit for your pilgrimage."
