#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#150 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#151 (mes)
- "First, please visit Father"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#152 (mes)
- "Rubalkabara who is Northeast"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#153 (mes)
- "of the Prontera Ruins."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#154 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#155 (mes)
- "Second, please visit Sister Mathilda. She is located in"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#156 (mes)
- "an area near Morocc, Southwest of Prontera."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#157 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#158 (mes)
- "The third Priest you must visit is Father Yosuke. He is in a field Northwest of Prontera."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#159 (mes)
- "[Bishop Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#160 (mes)
- "Well then, I wish you a safe journey. If you have any questions, please ask Sister Cecilia."
