#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#475 (mes)
- "to throw this all away...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#476 (mes)
- "Congratulations."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#477 (mes)
- "You've completed all three trials required for the Priesthood. Bishop Paul is now waiting for you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#478 (mes)
- "[Sister Cecilia]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#479 (mes)
- "Peace be with you..."
