#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#481 (mes)
- "Welcome!"
+ "Bem-vindo!"
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#482 (mes)
- "Brother "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#483 (mes)
- "!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#484 (mes)
- "Sister "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#485 (mes)
- "!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#486 (mes)
- "So good to see you again!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#487 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#488 (mes)
- "Are you here to help an Acolyte friend for the spiritual training? That's great~ I think you'll do a good job."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#489 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#490 (mes)
- "Remember, no matter how much you want to help this Acolyte, this is not your quest."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#491 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#492 (mes)
- "You may assist and lighten your friend's burden, but you take upon this task for yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#493 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#494 (mes)
- "So..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#495 (mes)
- "Are you gonna help him right now?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#496 (select)
- "Yes, I am.:Give me a minute.:I changed my mind."
