- "What for?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#503 (mes)
- "Well, so long as you arrive in time to help your friend, it will be okay."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#504 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#505 (mes)
- "Oh...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#506 (mes)
- "Then please,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#507 (mes)
- "go ahead. God bless"
