- "Welcome~!"
+ "Bem-vindo~!"
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#511 (mes)
- "I congratulate you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#512 (mes)
- "for passing the first trail."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#513 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#514 (mes)
- "My name is"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#515 (mes)
- "Peter S. Alberto."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#516 (mes)
- "How is my buddy Paul?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#517 (mes)
- "Is he doing alright"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#518 (mes)
- "these days?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#519 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#520 (mes)
- "Oh, I keep forgetting that he was promoted to Bishop. I think I'm supposed to call him Bishop Paul, or 'His Excellency.' Haha~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#521 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#522 (mes)
- "Anyway, let me give you a brief explanation of the spiritual training. Are you familiar with what the spiritual training is for Priests?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#523 (select)
- "Yes, I do.:Sorry..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#524 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#525 (mes)
- "Haha, I like you! But it never hurts to have too much information. The more well informed you are, the more easily you'll pass the test!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#526 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#527 (mes)
- "Oh, no need to be sorry. I'm here to give you the information you need anyway. So, don't worry."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#528 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#529 (mes)
- "In spiritual training, you will be defeating evil creatures. Creatures of the Undead and Demons are all evil. In choosing to serve darkness, they are our enemies!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#530 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#531 (mes)
- "There are too many evil creatures that roam this world against the will of God. Innocents suffer as a result of their malignance."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#532 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#533 (mes)
- "We, as Priests, are obligated to exterminate all those creatures, thus spreading love and peace."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#534 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#535 (mes)
- "This training will test your ability to eliminate evil. Since this trial is pretty difficult to be accomplished by yourself,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#536 (mes)
- "I recommend getting help from a Priest if you can."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#537 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#538 (mes)
- "If you are close to a Priest, you'd better ask him to assist you during this trial. Now, are you ready?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#539 (select)
- "I'm ready.:Please hold on.:I want to go back."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#540 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#541 (mes)
- "Now, let the spiritual training begin. It's simple. Just kill them all. Show no mercy to the creatures of darkness!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#542 (mes)
- "[Father Peter]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#543 (mes)
- "Now..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/priest.txt#544 (mes)
- "Go for it!"
+ ""
