#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#33 (mes)
- "[Wizard Guildsman]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#34 (mes)
- "My name is Catherine Medici. Just between me and you, I just became a Wizard too!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#35 (mes)
