#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#302 (mes)
- "[Raulel]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#303 (mes)
- "Hahahaha~ You don't know how dangerous it is...to deal with Greater Magic."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#304 (select)
- "I want to live as a normal Mage.:I would like to continue with the tests."
