- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1092 (mes)
- "You seem lost..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1093 (mes)
- "You've applied, and now you're looking for the items right?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1094 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1095 (mes)
- "But since this is only the first test, don't depend on others for help."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1096 (mes)
- "Complete it yourself, thats the best way."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1097 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1098 (mes)
- "From what I've heard, you have to gather elemental stones..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1099 (mes)
- "I can't help you directly, but I can give you some advice."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1100 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1101 (mes)
- "Well, you can find the Crystal Blue in Byalan Dungeon."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1102 (mes)
- "Cornutus, Kukre, Marina, Vadon...these monsters drop them frequently."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1103 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1104 (mes)
- "You can get Green Live from insect type monsters."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1105 (mes)
- "Try hunting monsters like Horn, Mantis, or Vitata."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1106 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1107 (mes)
- "Oh and *woof*, Red Blood. I heard you can get a lot of those from..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1108 (mes)
- "Elder Willows, Metallers or Scorpions found in the desert would work well too."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1109 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1110 (mes)
- "For Wind of Verdue. Hornet, Stainer, Steel Chonchon."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1111 (mes)
- "If you try just a bit, you can get them really easily."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1112 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1113 (mes)
- "But anyways, always try your best."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1114 (mes)
- "It's the basics of being a Wizard."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1115 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1116 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1117 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1118 (mes)
- "Don't be too relieved just after the first test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1119 (mes)
- "Try your best, as you still have two more tests to go."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1120 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1121 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1122 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1123 (mes)
- "ZzzzZzzzZzzz..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1124 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1125 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1126 (mes)
- "*wimper*...Blizadris...you suck...Zzz..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1127 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1128 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1129 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1130 (mes)
- "Oh, you're doing well aren't you?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1131 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1132 (mes)
- "Well, try your best to the very end."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1133 (mes)
- "Laurel is waiting."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1134 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1135 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1136 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1137 (mes)
- "*BARK*...you gave up?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1138 (mes)
- "*Sigh*...How can you become a Wizard with such a weak heart?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1139 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1140 (mes)
- "You know that each room has monsters of the same attribute..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1141 (mes)
- "If you're a person that deals with magic, you need to know about the different spells."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1142 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1143 (mes)
- "You also need to learn how to counter monsters that use skills."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1144 (mes)
- "Your best bet is to kill the monsters that are attacking you first."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1145 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1146 (mes)
- "*Grrr* Anyways, continue the test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1147 (mes)
- "Don't have a weak mind, *woof* and go back! *Bark* *Bark* Right this moment! *BARK*"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1148 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1149 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1150 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1151 (mes)
- "As I thought, I knew you'd be able to do it, I could smell it in yah! *Woof*"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1152 (mes)
- "Now I can call you Wizard."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1153 (mes)
- "[Maria]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1154 (mes)
- "Congratulations. Always give your best at everything, no matter what."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-1/wizard.txt#1155 (cutin)
- "job_wizard_maria01"
+ ""

