#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#35 (mes)
- "Welcome to the"
+ "Bem-vindo à"
#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#36 (mes)
- "Alchemist Union."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#37 (mes)
- "We are recruiting"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#38 (mes)
- "talented people"
