- "[Parmy Gianino]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#61 (mes)
- "Is that so?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/alchemist.txt#62 (mes)
- "Nice to meet you."
