### npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt  (513 textos)
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#3 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#4 (mes)
- "Chosen ones who are destined to become Gods"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#5 (mes)
- "are so many in this era"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#6 (mes)
- "but they never realise their fate while alive."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#7 (mes)
- "They end up to become ordinary men..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#8 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#9 (mes)
- "Wind and Clouds, please send this message to them,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#10 (mes)
- "who pursue food, clothing, shelter and wealth."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#11 (mes)
- "Tell them they are wasting their time..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#12 (mes)
- "Tell them they forget the most important goal of the life..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#13 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#14 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#15 (mes)
- "Ooh hey! How's your singing these days?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#16 (mes)
- "I wonder if your voice got any better."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
