- "Hahaha! Of course!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#54 (mes)
- "if you sing with a happy heart, your voice always gets better."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#55 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#56 (mes)
- "But, to Bards your voice is your life."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#57 (mes)
