#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#107 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#108 (mes)
- "Hey there Archer fellow."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#109 (mes)
- "How can a wanderer like me help you?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#110 (select)
- "You have a nice voice.:Could you sing for me, please?:Nothing."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#111 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#112 (mes)
- "Hoho, your voice is rather nice as well?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#113 (mes)
- "Ever think about singing?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#114 (select)
- "Of course!:I can't quite possibly..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#115 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#116 (mes)
- "Haha, nice attitude. You have to be like that to become a Bard."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#117 (mes)
- "I'll help you become a Bard then."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#118 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#119 (mes)
- "But before that... do you think you can bring me a Flower?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#120 (mes)
- "I need to smell the scent of a Flower to feel like teaching."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#121 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#122 (mes)
- "It doesn't really matter which Flower, but try to bring one that I like."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#123 (mes)
- "And don't just buy any random Flower, ok?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#124 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#125 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#126 (mes)
- "Haha, what a timid one."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#127 (mes)
- "Don't think so little of yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#128 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#129 (mes)
- "You have plenty of talent."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#130 (mes)
- "Come again if you change your mind."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#131 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#132 (mes)
- "Hmm... seems like you have some singing talents?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#133 (mes)
- "Don't just request songs.. singing to others is quite fun, too."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#134 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#135 (mes)
- "Try enjoying your life as a Bard."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#136 (mes)
- "You go from town to town, singing to the people. Doesn't it sound great?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#137 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#138 (mes)
- "Hmm... I'm not sure what's what, but enjoy life."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#139 (mes)
- "You look too uptight."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#140 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#141 (mes)
- "Well then~ Have a great time~"
