#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#144 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#145 (mes)
- "Welcome! Archer friend."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#146 (mes)
- "Did you bring a Flower? Let me see."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#147 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#148 (mes)
- "Ooh! It's a Singing Flower!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#149 (mes)
- "It's full of my memories..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#150 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#151 (mes)
- "My friend Tchaikovsky used to like it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#152 (mes)
- "I wonder what he's doing now..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#153 (mes)
- "Aah... the cute Hinelle..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#154 (mes)
- "It doesn't have a scent but it's a very moderate cute flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#155 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#156 (mes)
- "The leaves gave me strength when I used to fall."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#157 (mes)
- "I really like this flower, thank you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#158 (mes)
- "Aloe... This is a rare flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#159 (mes)
- "How'd you get it? Rather skilled, eh?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#160 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#161 (mes)
- "The leaves are good and Aloe Vera is delicious, too.."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#162 (mes)
- "but it's defnitely the most beautiful when it's a flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#163 (mes)
- "Ment... You can forget about all your hardships with one of these."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#164 (mes)
- "Nice to see it in such a long time!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#165 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#166 (mes)
- "I heard you can make Anodyne with it..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#167 (mes)
- "But that would be a slight waste.. thanks!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#168 (mes)
- "Ooh, isn't this an Izidor?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#169 (mes)
- "It's a dangerous yet beautiful flower..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#170 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#171 (mes)
- "The deep purple charms a person.. "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#172 (mes)
- "Thank you, I really like this flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#173 (mes)
- "Ooh, a Witherless Rose. The strong flower that doesn't wither."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#174 (mes)
- "Great to give to a girlfriend."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#175 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#176 (mes)
- "I wonder if it would be ok for a wanderer like me to accept it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#177 (mes)
- "Haha, it should be ok.. right?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#178 (mes)
- "Frozen Rose... you can't really call this a flower,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#179 (mes)
- "But it is still beautiful... a clear Rose."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#180 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#181 (mes)
- "You can call it a flower even though it doesn't have a scent anymore."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#182 (mes)
- "Then I'll greatly take this."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#183 (mes)
- "Oh, isn't this an Illusion Flower!?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#184 (mes)
- "Wow, how did you obtain such a rare flower!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#185 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#186 (mes)
- "Than you very much, aah... I feel like heaven is in front of my eyes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#187 (mes)
- "What a wonderful feeling! I'm really happy!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#188 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#189 (mes)
- "Eh? This is just a normal flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#190 (mes)
- "I like it... but it's not enough."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#191 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#192 (mes)
- "You can get this flower from the girl in Prontera."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#193 (mes)
- "Please bring me a different flower."
+ ""
