- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#195 (mes)
- "Oh no, you brought a Bouquet?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#196 (mes)
- "You can't bring me something like this."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#197 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#198 (mes)
- "Go give this to a graduating Sage or something."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#199 (mes)
- "Since it's great as that kind of gift... Bring a different flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#200 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#201 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#202 (mes)
- "Oy oy... did you go to a wedding or something?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#203 (mes)
- "What do you expect a guy to do with a Wedding Bouquet?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#204 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#205 (mes)
- "It's not me. Go give it to a lady or something."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#206 (mes)
- "This isn't the type of flower I wanted."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#207 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#208 (mes)
- "Mmm... a Fancy Flower."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#209 (mes)
- "It's nice... but this isn't good enough."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#210 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#211 (mes)
- "I like flowers that have a scent and are beautiful."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#212 (mes)
- "I don't like fake flowers that go on top of heads."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#213 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#214 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#215 (mes)
- "...Agh, why'd you bring such a hideous thing?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#216 (mes)
- "Are you thinking at all?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#217 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#218 (mes)
- "if you were trying to be funny, it was a good attempt..."
