- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#222 (mes)
- "Hmm? What... you didnt' bring anything."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#223 (mes)
- "Didn't I ask you to bring a flower?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#224 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#225 (mes)
- "Well... if you want to learn on your own, then so be it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#226 (mes)
- "Anyone can just go out and sing."
