#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#227 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo02"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#228 (cutin)
- "job_bard_aiolo01"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#229 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#230 (mes)
- "As I promised, I'll help you become a Bard."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#231 (mes)
- "But it's not easy my friend. Haha!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#232 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#233 (mes)
- "It is important to get to know a lot of people to learn how to sing."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#234 (mes)
- "You must also keep up with all the things going on in different villages..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#235 (mes)
- "[Lalo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#236 (mes)
- "There's a talking snowman in a town called Lutie."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/bard.txt#237 (mes)
