### npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt  (544 textos)
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#5 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#6 (mes)
- "Go and train yourself in preparation for the holy war that is coming. Victory will be in the hands of those who are most ready to receive it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#8 (mes)
- "You don't belong here, my friend."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#9 (mes)
- "Be advised to continue practicing yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#10 (mes)
- "Go and train yourself in preparation for the holy war that is coming. Victory will be in the hands of those who are most ready to receive it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#11 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#12 (mes)
- "Chaos will one day arise to challenge our principles of peace, justice and order. Until we have eliminated evil and created our ideal world, we must not cease training."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#13 (mes)
- "We are Crusaders,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#14 (mes)
- "warriors preparing"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#15 (mes)
- "to fight in the Holy War."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#16 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#17 (mes)
- "If you wish to join us, you must first learn the Swordsman discipline and train yourself thoroughly..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#18 (mes)
- "We are Crusaders,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#19 (mes)
- "warriors preparing"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#20 (mes)
- "to fight in the Holy War."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#22 (mes)
- "As it happened one thousand years ago, evil forces will one day attack in droves in an attempt to take over the world once again."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#23 (mes)
- "Ah..."
+ "Ah..."
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#24 (mes)
- "I see that you have been called to become a Crusader. We are assured of your will, but now we must test your capabilities."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#25 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#26 (mes)
- "Meet with Moorenak Miyol who is training in the underground dungeon of the Prontera Castle. Go, and speak with him first."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#27 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#28 (mes)
- "Moorenak and others like him will test the limits of your capabilities and help you find your path. Return to me after you have completed their tests..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#29 (mes)
- "We are Crusaders, warriors preparing for the Holy War."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#30 (mes)
- "What brings you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#31 (mes)
- "to this place?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#32 (select)
- "I want to prepare for the Holy War!:Nothing in particular."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#33 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#34 (mes)
- "You wish to become"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#35 (mes)
- "a Crusader...?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#36 (mes)
- "Joining us is not as"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#37 (mes)
- "easy as it sounds."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#38 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#39 (mes)
- "I am Michael Halig. I am one of but many Crusaders preparing for the Holy War. We continuously train ourselves with sincere faith and endless loyalty."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#40 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#41 (mes)
- "We recruit Swordsmen that express exceptional faith, or those who were born as warriors"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#42 (mes)
- "by Odin's will."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#43 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#44 (mes)
- "Possessing the ^3355FFChivalry Emblem^000000 and ^3355FFHand of God^000000 is seen as a sign that you have been called to become a Crusader."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#45 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#46 (mes)
- "After obtaining those items and passing our tests, you too, can become a Crusader."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#47 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#48 (mes)
- "I don't know what type of person you are right now though. But"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#49 (mes)
- "I shall test you if you desire. Are you willing to endure these tests in preparation for the Holy War?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#50 (select)
- "Yes, I do.:I'd like to think about it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#51 (mes)
- "[Michael Halig]"
