#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#251 (mes)
- "Welcome, we are Crusaders."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#252 (mes)
- "We are preparing for the"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#253 (mes)
- "foretold Holy War"
