#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#254 (mes)
- "that is to come."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#255 (mes)
- "[Gabriel Valentine]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#256 (mes)
- "I hope you will train yourself in preparation for the future as well."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#257 (mes)
- "Welcome. We are Crusaders."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#258 (mes)
- "We are preparing for the"
