#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#262 (mes)
- "If you would like to become a Crusader, please speak with our leader in the Prontera Central Palace."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#263 (mes)
- "Welcome."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#264 (mes)
- "Did you do well"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#265 (mes)
- "on those painful tests?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#266 (mes)
- "I will be conducting your next test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#267 (mes)
- "[Gabriel Valentine]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#268 (mes)
- "My name is Gabriel Valentine. I, too, am preparing for the Holy War. For the time being, I act as guard for this church."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#269 (mes)
- "[Gabriel Valentine]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#270 (mes)
- "I will test to see if you have acquired the knowledge that is necessary to become a Crusader."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#271 (mes)
- "We can't very well win the Holy War just by swinging a sword."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#272 (mes)
- "[Gabriel Valentine]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/crusader.txt#273 (mes)
- "I will give"
