#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#497 (mes)
- "for the Dance Test?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#498 (mes)
- "If you like, I can"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#499 (mes)
- "explain the instructions."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#500 (select)
- "Listen to instructions.:Go to the testing area."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#501 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#502 (mes)
- "First of all, each person gets ^CD68891 minute^000000 for the test, and everyone dances ^CD6889one at a time^000000. Don't worry if you've never danced before~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#503 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#504 (mes)
- "Once you enter the testing area, you will see the stage. First, ^CD6889change your camera angle so that it faces forward^000000. It will probably work if you ^CD6889double-click on the right mouse button^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#505 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#506 (mes)
- "If you don't reset your camera angle, you may get the ^CD6889Up, Down, Left, Right^000000 commands confused."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#507 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#508 (mes)
- "Wait for your turn in the ^CD6889waiting room^000000. If the person in front of you fails, or if it's your turn in line, your test will begin."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#509 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#510 (mes)
- "If there are a lot of people, not everyone might fit in the waiting room. If that's the case, just create an orderly line~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#511 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#512 (mes)
- "When the test begins, the music will be broadcast, as well as the direction in which you should move. Just follow the instructions and move your legs."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#513 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#514 (mes)
- "Remember, ^CD6889you will be disqualified if you don't perform the steps with the right timing^000000. Be careful, the test is very strict~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#515 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#516 (mes)
- "Well then~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#517 (mes)
- "Good luck...!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#519 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#520 (mes)
- "Oh my..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#521 (mes)
- "Did you"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#522 (mes)
- "fail last time?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#523 (mes)
- "Don't worry, just"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#524 (mes)
- "try to feel the rhythm~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#526 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#527 (mes)
- "You can't change jobs"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#528 (mes)
- "if you still have skill"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#529 (mes)
- "points left. Use the rest"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#530 (mes)
- "and come back later."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#531 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#532 (mes)
- "Oh my..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#533 (mes)
- "I saw your"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#534 (mes)
- "dance earlier."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#535 (mes)
- "You were great!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#536 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#537 (mes)
- "Your performance shows that you are than qualified to become a Dancer. Well then, let me change your job."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#538 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#539 (mes)
- "With the blessing of our goddess, you shall be reborn as a Dancer. From now on, no one will leave your presense without a smile~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#540 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#543 (mes)
- "Ooh...!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#544 (mes)
- "You look great"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#545 (mes)
- "as a Dancer~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#546 (mes)
- "Congratulations!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#547 (mes)
- "[Bijou]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#548 (mes)
- "Here's a small"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#549 (mes)
- "gift from me."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#550 (mes)
- "Please take it."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#551 (mes)
- "May your performances always bring joy to your audience~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#562 (mes)
- "[Pyorgin]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#563 (mes)
- "Please wait in"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#564 (mes)
- "the waiting room."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#565 (mes)
- "Click the Chatroom"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#566 (mes)
- "box to enter."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#567 (mes)
- "[Pyorgin]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#568 (mes)
- "Also, those who"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#569 (mes)
- "are curious about"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt#570 (mes)
- "the test can watch"
