#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#184 (mes)
- "[Sensei Moohae]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#185 (mes)
- "Greetings, you seem to be on a pure path."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#186 (mes)
- "Come in, come in, what can I do for you today?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#187 (mes)
- "[Sensei Moohae]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#188 (mes)
- "If you have free skill points, you will lose them during a job change."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#189 (mes)
- "Make sure to use any skill points you have."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#190 (mes)
- "[Sensei Moohae]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#191 (mes)
- "I sense a fighting spirit, do you wish to become a monk? "
