#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1006 (mes)
- "[Touha]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1007 (mes)
- "...well done, that was perfect. You pay attention well..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1008 (mes)
- "[Touha]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1009 (mes)
- "However, now is not the time to relax. Your path is still long ahead of you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1010 (mes)
- "[Touha]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1011 (mes)
- "Now as I promised, I will help strengthen your body."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1012 (mes)
- "Focus your mind and do not move."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1013 (mes)
- "^33CCFFYou feel wind all around your body.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1014 (mes)
- "^33CCFFAn energy within you grows.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1015 (mes)
- "[Touha]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1016 (mes)
- "I feel what grows within you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1017 (mes)
- "You may now continue on..."
+ ""
