+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1255 (mes)
- "We planted a garden in order to survive as well as to discipline our minds."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1256 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1257 (mes)
- "I believe there is no better way to find true inner peace then to be one with nature."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1258 (mes)
- "So we created our garden, however these mushrooms started sprouting up everywhere!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1259 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1260 (mes)
- "What we ask of you as part of your training is to remove these mushrooms."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1261 (mes)
- "Go help the others remove as many mushrooms as you can and bring me back"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1262 (mes)
- "enough ^FF0000Orange Net Mushrooms^000000 and ^FF0000Orange Gooey Mushroom^000000 as proof."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1263 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1264 (mes)
- "Now, go get some mushrooms."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1265 (mes)
- "Check back with me when you have picked some, I will tell you if it is enough."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1266 (mes)
- "And remember, find peace when gardening."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1267 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1268 (mes)
- "...or do you want to quit?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1269 (select)
- "No.:Yes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1270 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1271 (mes)
- "Alright then, keep going."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1272 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1273 (mes)
- ".....yeah I thought as much....you don't have the spirit needed to become a monk."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1281 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1282 (mes)
- "...hmm... not bad."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1283 (mes)
- "Ok, you passed."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1284 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1285 (mes)
- "Go meet Tomoon for your next test."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1286 (mes)
- "Tomoon is staying in the deepest room inside a building near this abbey."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1288 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1289 (mes)
- "Didn't I tell you to go meet ^FF0000Tomoon^000000? Or do you want to pick some more mushrooms?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1290 (mes)
- "Tomoon is staying in the deepest room inside a building near this abbey."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1291 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1292 (mes)
- "As I see vegetables growing, I feel myself growing within."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1293 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1294 (mes)
- "As I see other monks working hard on growing vegetables,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1295 (mes)
- "it warms my heart to see others enjoying gardening as I do."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1296 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1297 (mes)
- "To be honest with you, I think gardening is the greatest thing ever..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1298 (mes)
- "We should give thanks to the brothers who prepare our food for us through their hard work."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1299 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1300 (mes)
- "Don't forget to thank them as you go by for their hard work."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1301 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1302 (mes)
- "Didn't I tell you to go meet Tomoon? Or do you want to pick more mushrooms?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1303 (mes)
- "Tomoon is staying in the deepest room inside a building near this abbey."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1304 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1305 (mes)
- "As I see vegetables growing, I feel myself growing within."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1306 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1307 (mes)
- "As I see other monks working hard on growing vegetables,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1308 (mes)
- "it warms my heart to see others enjoying gardening as I do."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1309 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1310 (mes)
- "To be honest with you, I think gardening is the greatest thing ever..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1311 (mes)
- "We should give thanks to the brothers who prepare our food for us through their hard work."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1312 (mes)
- "[Hyunmoo]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1313 (mes)
- "Don't forget to thank them as you go by for their hard work."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1314 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1315 (mes)
- "Welcome young one."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1316 (mes)
- "My name is Tomoon, I am in charge of the last test of spiritual training!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1317 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1318 (mes)
- "Now you don't need to be instructed any more than this:"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1319 (mes)
- "^990000Terminate every living thing in your way!^000000 That's all!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1320 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1321 (mes)
- "While you're wandering around within the maze, if you encounter any evil creatures, just kill them! Release their tortured souls!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1322 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1323 (mes)
- "Do not compare us to the weakling priests! We are monks and we will always be the strongest!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1324 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1325 (mes)
- "We are not like priests who cower behind the strength of others!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1326 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1327 (mes)
- "Now, focus!! Keep your fists tight and your eyes open! It's time to show me what you got."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1328 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1329 (mes)
- "Let's see if you got what it takes to be a true monk!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1331 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1332 (mes)
- "Hmm... you failed?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1333 (mes)
- "Cheer up! Failure is but a process to success!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1334 (mes)
- "Go! Start again! Kill them all!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1336 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1337 (mes)
- "Excellent job!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1338 (mes)
- "I knew you'd make it through!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1339 (mes)
- "Now...I will give you a secret potion which will double your physical strength."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1340 (mes)
- "Drink this potion and you will be able to become a monk!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1341 (mes)
- "... now go back to sensei Moohae!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1342 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1343 (mes)
- "I already told you, go back to sensei Moohae!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1344 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1345 (mes)
- "....be quiet."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1346 (mes)
- "....."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1347 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1348 (mes)
- "I will not allow anyone to cause any trouble in this abbey."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1349 (mes)
- "[Tomoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1350 (mes)
- "You'd better not be thinking about causing any trouble."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1351 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1352 (mes)
- "So, are you ready to undergo the spiritual training?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1353 (select)
- "Yes!:No.:What do I have to do?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1354 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1355 (mes)
- "Alright! I wish you luck. If you get lost and can't find a way out, simply log out and log back in."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1356 (mes)
- "Then you will return to your save point. What's that mean? Heck if I know, I'm just told to say that. Oh yes and also, please cooperate with your comrades."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1358 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1359 (mes)
- "I see. Take your time."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1360 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1361 (mes)
- "Inside this test hall is the maze of spirits."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1362 (mes)
- "There are spirits inside which will block you from moving freely."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1363 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1364 (mes)
- "If you want to exit the test hall, you must make your way to the warp portal located at the opposite side from the start point."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1365 (mes)
- "[Proctor]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1366 (mes)
- "....Oh yes and also there are monsters wandering around in the maze, please clear them."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/monk.txt#1367 (mes)
- "Good luck."
