#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#11 (mes)
- "Damn this worthless life!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#12 (mes)
- "[Thug]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#13 (mes)
- "Hey, kid."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#14 (mes)
- "What the hell"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#15 (mes)
- "are you lookin' at?"
