#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#16 (select)
- "Me? N-nothing!':........"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Thug]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#18 (mes)
- "Then get the"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#19 (mes)
- "hell out of my face!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#20 (mes)
- "Didn't you hear me?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#21 (mes)
- "Get lost!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#22 (mes)
- "[Thug]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#23 (mes)
- "Hmmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#24 (mes)
- "Maybe I'll swing by the ^0000FFRogue Guild^000000 in ^0000FFParos Lighthouse^000000..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#25 (mes)
- "[Thug]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#26 (mes)
- "I needz my money,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#27 (mes)
- "and they best have it..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#28 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#29 (mes)
- "Eh? You...you...?!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#30 (mes)
- "Hey, haven't we met before?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#32 (mes)
- ".............."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#33 (mes)
- "Awww, ^FF0000I am sorry^000000! I think I misunderstood you from someone I know."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#34 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#35 (mes)
- "......."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#36 (mes)
- "........It is strange though. Umm."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#37 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#38 (mes)
- "I never misunderstand people...oh well, be safe anyway!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#39 (mes)
- "[Rogue Guildsman]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#40 (mes)
- "Yo, what are you doin'?!"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#41 (mes)
- "You can't change your job if you got unused skill points, so use 'em all up. You bettah check yo-self before you wreck yo-self."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#42 (mes)
- "[Rogue Guildsman]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#43 (mes)
- "So what's a kid"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#44 (mes)
- "like you doin' here?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#45 (mes)
- "Oh, I get it now..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#46 (mes)
- "The widdle boy wants"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#47 (mes)
- "Oh, I see..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#48 (mes)
- "Lil' cutie wants "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#49 (mes)
- "to be a ^800000Rogue^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#50 (mes)
- "[Rogue Guildsman]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#51 (mes)
- "Eh, nice meetin' you, I guess. I'm Markie, and I do work for the Rogue Guild, a philanthro-- *ahem* a ^800000feelanthropist^000000 group, as you can see. So what's your name?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#52 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#53 (mes)
- "..."
+ "..."
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#54 (mes)
- "?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#55 (mes)
- "Heh heh! Cool name."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#56 (mes)
- "If it was dorky, we'd"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#57 (mes)
- "make you change it,"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#58 (mes)
- "so you're in luck."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#59 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#60 (mes)
- "So why you wanna join up with the Rogues? I guess you gave me your real name, so you'd be an honest Rogue. Not many of those around, heh heh~"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#61 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#62 (mes)
- "Rule number 1 for Rogues..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#63 (mes)
- "Never give out your real identity to most people, most of the time. It's just a little backup measure we like to use."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#64 (mes)
- "[Markie]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/rogue.txt#65 (mes)
- "Right. I'm officially accepting your application, so now you gotta take a test. Don't sweat it, this first one is real simple."
