#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#663 (mes)
- "What are you doing here? Aren't you supposed to be with Dean Kayron?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#664 (mes)
- "Oh well, there's no harm in showing me your dissertation though..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#665 (mes)
- "[Hermes Tris]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#666 (mes)
- "But then again, maybe there is. Go see Dean Kayron."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#667 (mes)
- "Oh sorry, I'm quite busy at the moment..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#668 (mes)
- "If you have any questions, go visit the professor I've assigned to you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#669 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#670 (mes)
- "Do I know you? Were you one of my students?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#671 (mes)
- "Oh, it doesn't matter anyway. You wouldn't be a Sage without graduating from this academy..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#672 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#673 (mes)
- "In any case, you must study the past in order to better understand the present and to predict...the future."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#674 (mes)
- "This sentence contains all the truth of the world."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#675 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#676 (mes)
- "I guess you're treading the right path..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#677 (mes)
- "One of these days you'll look back to this moment and realize it changed your life."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#678 (mes)
- "A Novice? Why is a novice here?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#679 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#680 (mes)
- "One whose life has many possibilities... "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#681 (mes)
- "How do you wish to lead your life?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#682 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#683 (mes)
- "No matter what you decide to be, everything depends on your choice."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#684 (mes)
- "May God bless you so that you can choose the path best for you..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#685 (mes)
- "Welcome, I am in charge of historical studies here in the academy."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#686 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#687 (mes)
- "The world as we know it is a result of events that described in the records of the ages. It is historical events that have shaped the world as it is today."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#688 (mes)
- "Therefore, knowing the past means you will better understand the present and...the future."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#689 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#690 (mes)
- "Reflect upon your past."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#691 (mes)
- "You will see your path in the future..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#692 (mes)
- "Welcome, "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#693 (mes)
- ". I am glad to meet you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#694 (mes)
- "My name is Saphien Layless, I will be in charge of your class for a while."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#695 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#696 (mes)
- "The subject you're studying is Yggdrasil."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#697 (mes)
- "So...do you even know what Yggdrasil is?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#698 (select)
- "Yes, I know very well.:No, I don't."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#699 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#700 (mes)
- "Okay then, what is Yggdrasil?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#701 (mes)
- "Please answer me."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#702 (select)
- "It's a name of a health item.:It's the source of life in the world.:Suckah, I lied."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#703 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#704 (mes)
- "Wrong. "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#705 (mes)
- ", you got - 10 points."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#706 (mes)
- "That's just one of the gifts from Yggdrasil."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#707 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#708 (mes)
- "Yggdrasil is the name of the tree that is the source of life in this world."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#709 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#710 (mes)
- "That's right. Yggdrasil, the so-called 'World Tree', "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#711 (mes)
- "is the name of the tree that has been the source of life in this world."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#712 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#713 (mes)
- "Great Schott...If you don't know, just say so."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#714 (mes)
- "By the way, "
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#715 (mes)
- ", you just got - 10 points for lying and for being wrong."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#716 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#717 (mes)
- "Ah well, I expected you would know at least a little bit about Yggdrasil..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#718 (mes)
- "Yggdrasil is the name of the tree that is the source of life in this world."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#719 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#720 (mes)
- "Before we start the class, I'll need some reserve items."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#721 (mes)
- "It's for better understanding of Yggdrasil."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#722 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#723 (mes)
- "Anything is fine as long as it's related to the Yggdrasil tree."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#724 (mes)
- "Seeds or fruits of the tree would be good. I know it's difficult to find, but please try."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#725 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#726 (mes)
- "When we have the reserve items, we will start the class."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#727 (mes)
- "Please come back."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#728 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#729 (mes)
- "Oh, did you bring them with you? Excellent!"
