#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#739 (mes)
- "Listen carefully, I will not accept dozing off in the middle of class."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#740 (mes)
- "[Saphien Layless]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#741 (mes)
- "Hmm, did you prepare for class? Let's see..."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#742 (mes)
- "Yggdrasil Leaf..."
