#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#917 (mes)
- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#918 (mes)
- "You're allowed to watch. However, do not disturb them by making any fuss."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#919 (mes)
