#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#928 (mes)
- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#929 (mes)
- "A fine name. It's nice to meet you."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#930 (mes)
- "So, are you aware of the subject you're studying?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#931 (mes)
- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#932 (mes)
- "As you know, your topic of study is monsters."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#933 (mes)
