- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#969 (mes)
- "Yes, they possess water property and at the same time they are fishes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#970 (mes)
- "Most fish class monsters live underwater, so they are attributed with the water property."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#971 (mes)
- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#972 (mes)
- "Yes, they possess water property and at the same time they are fishes."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#973 (mes)
- "Most fish class monsters live underwater, so they are attributed with the water property."
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#974 (mes)
- "[Lucius Celsus]"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#975 (mes)
- "...I didn't know Phens were aggressive nowadays?"
+ ""
#: npc/jobs/2-2/sage.txt#976 (mes)
